        ],
        "block_id": 3,
        "block_order": null
      },
      {
        "block_label": "text",
        "block_content": "The Casino sector continues to be heavily taxed under the current UK tax system. During the financial year to December 2025 the Company paid a total of £45.0m (2024: £44.1m) in duties, social security, PAYE, VAT and licensing costs. This tax burden accounts for 39% (2024: 38%) of our turnover. The Company employed an average of 703 employees (2024: 692).\n",
        "block_bbox": [
          312,
          1082,
          2169,
          1239
        ],
        "block_id": 4,
        "block_order": 4
      },
      {
        "block_label": "paragraph_title",
        "block_content": "Non-Financial Performance Measures ",
        "block_bbox": [
          315,
          1285,
          966,
          1318
        ],
        "block_id": 5,
        "block_order": 5
      },
      {
        "block_label": "text",
        "block_content": "The Company also measures its performance against non-financial KPl's including via an independent mystery shopper program across all operational departments and scored appropriately. The score is scrutinised and acted upon to ensure a consistent excellent service across the entire Hippodrome business. The Company also measures attendance, visits per customer, time since last visit, gaming drop and theoretical win.",
        "block_bbox": [
          311,
          1370,
          2166,
          1532
        ],
        "block_id": 6,
        "block_order": 6
      },
      {
        "block_label": "paragraph_title",
        "block_content": "Future Outlook ",
        "block_bbox": [
          313,
          1576,
          578,
          1607
        ],
        "block_id": 7,
        "block_order": 7
      },
      {
        "block_label": "text",
        "block_content": "Although there is still some uncertainty in the economy, particularly with respect cost of living and energy costs which feed directly to varying degrees into the consumer spending patterns upon which we rely, there is evidence that a recovery is in progress. Our core market and customer base remains resilient and with key projects planned and underway we are well positioned for future growth \n",
        "block_bbox": [
          308,
          1659,
          2164,
          1819
        ],
        "block_id": 8,
        "block_order": 8
      },
      {
        "block_label": "text",
        "block_content": "On behalf of the Board ",
        "block_bbox": [
          313,
          1861,
          684,
          1895
        ],
        "block_id": 9,
        "block_order": 9
      },
